{
  "info": {
    "name": "Producer API Collection - Advanced Size Management + Category Types (RPK-52)",
    "description": "Complete API collection untuk Producer role dengan Advanced-Only Size Management System dan Category Type Support untuk Dynamic Forms. Includes produk, kategori, warna, material, advanced size management, dan category-based dynamic form system.\n\n🆕 ADVANCED-ONLY ARCHITECTURE:\n• All products now require sizes dengan age categories (ADULT/CHILD/UNIVERSAL)\n• Aggregated size display dengan breakdown capabilities\n• Business logic validation dan performance monitoring\n• Pure advanced architecture: no legacy single-size support\n• Real-time aggregation dengan caching (5min TTL)\n\n🆕 CATEGORY TYPES (RPK-52 - Dynamic Form System):\n• 'clothing': Baju, Celana, Kemeja → Size management (S/M/L/XL)\n• 'accessories_age_based': Sarung, Songket → Dewasa/Anak fields\n• 'accessories_universal': Anting, Gelang → Single quantity field\n• Dynamic form rendering based on category type\n• Full backward compatibility dengan existing categories\n\n🔗 DEPENDENCIES & EXECUTION ORDER:\n1. Setup: Login → Get session token\n2. Prerequisites: Create Category (dengan type support) → Create Color → (Optional) Create Material\n3. Products: Create/Update products dengan advanced size management dan category validation\n4. Size Management: Test aggregation, validation, advanced scenarios\n5. Category Testing: Test type field validation dan dynamic form support\n6. Testing: Run comprehensive integration scenarios\n\n📋 REQUIRED VARIABLES:\n- base_url: http://localhost:3000\n- clerk_session_token: From browser cookies\n- Auto-captured: product_id, category_id, color_id, material_id, size_id, accessories_age_based_category_id, accessories_universal_category_id\n\n⚡ PERFORMANCE TARGETS:\n- Aggregation: <50ms calculation time\n- Cache Hit Rate: >80% untuk optimal performance\n- Response Time: <2s SLA maintained\n- Category Validation: <100ms per request\n\n📚 Full documentation: docs/api/manage-product-endpoints.md | docs/api/manage-product-business-logic.md | docs/task.md (RPK-52)",
    "version": "4.1.0",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
